 request</button></td></tr>{:else}<tr><td colspan="4">No requests. This system does not pay out money.</td></tr>{/each}</tbody></table></div></section><section><h2>Wallet journal</h2>{#each data.journal as row}<p>{row.type} ·{money(row.cashDeltaCents)} ·{new Date(row.at).toLocaleString()}</p>{:else}<p>Your journal is empty.</p>{/each}</section>{/if}<footer>OmieBot AI Trading · Evidence before execution</footer></main>
